{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35837","headline":"酬进士秦顒若 · 李咸用","name":"酬进士秦顒若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莺默平林燕别轩，相逢相笑话生前。\n低飞旅恨看霜叶，曲写归情向暮川。\n在野孤云终捧日，朝宗高浪本蒙泉。\n何劳怅望风雷便，且混鱼龙黩武年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}